  "goodToKnow": "Die Neuerung is an innovation or change, usually to rules or a system: die wichtigsten Neuerungen im neuen Jahr, a favourite headline every January when new laws come into force in Germany. Technische Neuerungen are technical innovations. Don't confuse it with die Neuigkeit (piece of news) or die Neuheit (novelty, new product). Erneuern means to renew. Plural: die Neuerungen."
